/images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15ld5.jpg"}, {"id": 1940584, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15ld4.jpg"}, {"id": 1940586, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15ld6.jpg"}, {"id": 1940583, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15ld3.jpg"}], "slug": "project-afterfall", "storyline": "At the height of urban civilisation, Thea\u2019s sprawling mega-cities stood as monuments to human achievement. Then came the Darkness \u2014 a cataclysm that shattered society, claimed billions of lives, and left the world in ruin. In the chaos, a secret network of underground shelters became the last refuge for the few who survived.\n\nProject Thea, the final remnant of the Ostoya mega-city, now stands as sentient-kind\u2019s last hope. As its sole guardian, you must venture into the treacherous Wastelands to scavenge vital resources, confront roaming threats, and guide the Project\u2019s growth. Every decision counts \u2014 for if the Project falls, civilisation will fall with it.", "summary": "A dark, strategy-survival RPG blending retro-futuristic urban fantasy with Slavic folklore. Set in the wolrd of Thea, but thrust 1000 years into an urban future. Rebuild your colony, explore the post-apocalyptic wasteland, and engage in tactical card-based combat. Immerse yourself in a story-rich adventure with branching narratives.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/project-afterfall", "videos": [{"id": 158959, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "YEYHGRQda-M", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YEYHGRQda-M", "title": "Project Thea Gameplay Demo Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YEYHGRQda-M/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 198738, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "5j4jRuu5TyM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5j4jRuu5TyM", "title": "Project Afterfall 1.0 Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi